4. HOW WE VERIFY THIS BACKEND
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Test Suite: We will test HTTP APIs using local request scripts (e.g. mocha/jest or custom scripts).
- Web3 Simulation: We can simulate blockchain events by calling the smart contract 
  on a local blockchain network (like Hardhat/Anvil) or a public testnet (Sepolia/Polygon Amoy)
  and verifying that the listener catches events in real-time and logs them to MongoDB.